From: Adrien Delmas <adrien@adriendelmas.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 19:46:27 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 126/133] hydra: cook op: COP textures to files as a USD Render
 ROP saves

husk, which the USD Render ROP and farms run, has no Houdini session: an
op: texture path could not be read there (Karma black, Cycles magenta).
An output processor, hdcycles_cookcoptextures, cooks each referenced COP
through flatten_op_textures to an EXR in cop_textures/ beside the layer the
ROP writes and points the saved path at it. Creation scripts add it to
every new USD Render ROP, in LOPs and in /out (K-40).
